      "transliteration": "אַתָּה הוּא מוֹשִׁיעֵנוּ",
      "english": "You are our rescuer."
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Atta taḳum teraḥem tsiyon",
      "transliteration": "אַתָּ֣ה תָ֭קוּם תְּרַחֵ֣ם צִיּ֑וֹן",
      "english": "You will arise, and have compassion upon Zion;"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*ki ‘et leḥanenah ki va mo‘ed.",
      "transliteration": "*כִּי־עֵ֥ת לְ֝חֶֽנְנָ֗הּ כִּי־בָ֥א מוֹעֵֽד׃",
      "english": "for it is time to be gracious unto her, for the appointed time has come. (Psalms 102:14)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Birkat adonai alechem,",
      "transliteration": "בִּרְכַּֽת־יְהֹוָ֥ה אֲלֵיכֶ֑ם",
      "english": "Adonai’s blessing be upon you;"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*berachnu et’chem beshem adonai.",
      "transliteration": "*בֵּרַ֥כְנוּ אֶ֝תְכֶ֗ם בְּשֵׁ֣ם יְהֹוָֽה׃",
      "english": "we bless you in the name of Adonai. (Psalms 129:8)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Adonai zecharanu yevarech,",
      "transliteration": "יְהֹוָה֮ זְכָרָ֢נוּ יְבָ֫רֵ֥ךְ",
      "english": "Adonai has been mindful of us, he will bless— he will bless the house of Israel; he will bless the house of Aaron. (Psalms 115:12)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Yevarech et bet hallevi,",
      "transliteration": "יְבָרֵךְ אֶת בֵּית הַלֵּוִי",
      "english": "May he bless the House of Levi; may he bless this holy congregation."
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Yevarech et kelal ḳehillot yeshurun.",
      "transliteration": "יְבָרֵךְ אֶת כְּלַל קְהִלּוֹת יְשֻׁרוּן.",
      "english": "May he bless all congregations of Jeshurun [the Jewish People]."
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Yevarech yir’ē adonai haḳḳetannim ‘im haggedolim.",
      "transliteration": "יְ֭בָרֵךְ יִרְאֵ֣י יְהֹוָ֑ה הַ֝קְּטַנִּ֗ים עִם־הַגְּדֹלִֽים׃",
      "english": "He will bless them that fear Adonai, both small and great. (Psalms 115:13)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Yosef adonai ‘alechem, ‘alechem ve‘al benechem.",
      "transliteration": "יֹסֵ֣ף יְהֹוָ֣ה עֲלֵיכֶ֑ם עֲ֝לֵיכֶ֗ם וְעַל־בְּנֵיכֶֽם׃",
      "english": "May Adonai increase you more and more, you and your children. (Psalms 115:14)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Beruchim attem ladonai",
      "transliteration": "בְּרוּכִ֣ים אַ֭תֶּם לַיהֹוָ֑ה",
      "english": "Blessed be you of Adonai,"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*‘osē shamayim va’arets.",
      "transliteration": "*עֹ֝שֵׂ֗ה שָׁמַ֥יִם וָאָֽרֶץ׃",
      "english": "who made heaven and earth. (Psalms 115:15)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Haḳḳaton yihyē la’elef vehats-tsa‘ir leḡoy ‘atsum,",
      "transliteration": "הַקָּטֹן֙ יִהְיֶ֣ה לָאֶ֔לֶף וְהַצָּעִ֖יר לְג֣וֹי עָצ֑וּם",
      "english": "The smallest shall become a thousand, and the least shall be a mighty nation;"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*ani adonai be‘ittah aḥishenna.",
      "transliteration": "*אֲנִ֥י יְהֹוָ֖ה בְּעִתָּ֥הּ אֲחִישֶֽׁנָּה׃",
      "english": "I, Adonai, will hasten it in its time. (Isaiah 60:22)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Bonē yerushalayim adonai",
      "transliteration": "בּוֹנֵ֣ה יְרוּשָׁלַ֣͏ִם יְהֹוָ֑ה",
      "english": "Adonai builds up Jerusalem,"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*nidḥē yisra’el yechannes.",
      "transliteration": "*נִדְחֵ֖י יִשְׂרָאֵ֣ל יְכַנֵּֽס׃",
      "english": "he gathers together the dispersed of Israel. (Psalms 147:2)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Borē niv sefatayim,",
      "transliteration": "בּוֹרֵ֖א נִ֣יב שְׂפָתָ֑יִם",
      "english": "The one who creates the fruit of the lips –"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*shalom shalom laraḥoḳ velaḳḳarov amar adonai urfativ.",
      "transliteration": "*שָׁל֨וֹם ׀ שָׁל֜וֹם לָרָח֧וֹק וְלַקָּר֛וֹב אָמַ֥ר יְהֹוָ֖ה וּרְפָאתִֽיו׃",
      "english": "*“Peace, peace, to people both far off and nearby” – says Adonai – “and I will heal them.” (Isaiah 57:19)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Hamshel vafaḥad ‘immo,",
      "transliteration": "הַמְשֵׁ֣ל וָפַ֣חַד עִמּ֑וֹ",
      "english": "Dominion and fear are with him;"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*‘osē shalom bimromav.",
      "transliteration": "*עֹשֶׂ֥ה שָׁ֝ל֗וֹם בִּמְרוֹמָֽיו׃",
      "english": "he makes peace in his high places. (Job 25:2)"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "Adonai ‘oz le‘ammo yitten,",
      "transliteration": "יְֽהֹוָ֗ה עֹ֭ז לְעַמּ֣וֹ יִתֵּ֑ן",
      "english": "Adonai gives might to his people;"
    },
    {
      "hebrew": "*adonai yevarech et ‘ammo vash-shalom.",
      "transliteration": "*יְהֹוָ֓ה ׀ יְבָרֵ֖ךְ אֶת־עַמּ֣וֹ בַשָּׁלֽוֹם׃",
      "english": "*Adonai blesses his people with peace. (Psalms 29:11)"
    }
  ],
